  "validation_history": [
    "The first lifecycle fixture used incorrect legacy prices and a wrong snapshot field. It was corrected to authored costs and the existing snapshot structure; strict 41-check suite passed.",
    "Shell tests initially expected instant construction. They now assert paid unavailability, advance injected deadlines and verify completion before continuing existing checks.",
